+ | 60–180s | Shut down quickly | Shared hosting, strict resource constraints |
+ | 300s (default) | Balanced | General-purpose use |
+ | 600–1800s | Stay warm | Batch processing, high-frequency usage |
+ ### MAX_TABS Configuration
