+ lsof -i :9377
+ # or
+ ss -tlnp | grep 9377
+ Then kill it:
+ kill -9 <PID>
+ If nothing shows up but the port is still blocked, check for zombie processes:
+ ps aux | grep -i camo
+ Clean any stale socket files that may linger:
+ rm -f /tmp/camofox-server.sock
